;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Affettuoso during the Despair install (214214 + two attacks, 1 bar): instead of waiting as a counter,
; she rushes forward; on contact the original stab sequence starts (3410 / opponent 3490, same as the counter).
; Invincible during the rush, unblockable, ground opponents only. A whiff leaves her open.
